	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Valde et supra modum doleo casum <placeName ref="l830">Anglicanę</placeName> ecclesię, mi frater in domino venerande; cuperem centies mori quam de <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostris ecclesiis tale quidpiam experiri.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Extendit dominus iratam manum suam in nos multoties commeritos, ut, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>dominus suos ad se rapuerit, vereor lamentabiliora experturos esse; tam induruit cor nostrum in malitia et <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>immensa ingratitudine erga oblatum nobis dei inenarrabile beneficium.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">O domine, libera tuos e tam perverso <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sęculo, ne patiare nomen tuum diutius blasphemari.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Spero brevi nos abituros, mi frater, in eternam patriam; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>faxit deus, ut, quod reliquum nobis est vitę, pro ipsius veritate et gloria multa animi parrhesia impendamus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Alias mediocriter valeo cum uxore et liberis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Filia <persName ref="p6505">Anna</persName> nondum michi reconciliata est; forte eius <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nulla tangitur cura.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Man sagt mir gloubwirdig, myn gegenschwäher der pfarrer zuͦ <placeName>Gauchlingen</placeName> halte <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sich gar übel und uneerlich; er hure alßo, das imme aber, wie vormals ouch beschähen, ein uneelich <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>kind werde.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><persName>Constantinus der jung</persName> trybt unmäßliche hochfart und muͤtwyll; ich sorg übel, myn tochter <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>syge ubel verfaren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Der herr wolle es mitt sinen gnaden beßeren.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus tecum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tuis, uxore et liberis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te arcis et urbis praefectus et precipue <persName ref="p8369">Hammanus</persName> noster.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Datum <placeName ref="l285">Lentzburgi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>10. septembris 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p8440">Gervasius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Fideli Christi servo <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino fratri et veteri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>amico charissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ad manus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
